Translate the following text into {{ target_language }}. Adjust the tone according to the specified instructions.

**Original Text:** {{ source_text }}

**Target Language:** {{ target_language }}

**Tone:** {{ desired_tone }}

{% if user.role == "admin" %}
// @rule RULE:AdminOverride category=policy priority=10
// Allows admin users to override tone instructions.
Instructions: As an administrator, you have the final say. If the tone instructions are unclear or conflicting, prioritize clarity and accuracy.
{% else %}
// @rule RULE:ToneAdherence category=policy priority=5
// Ensures the AI adheres to the requested tone.
Instructions: Carefully consider the requested tone and ensure the translation reflects it.
{% endif %}

{% if desired_tone == "formal" %}
// @rule RULE:FormalTranslation category=style priority=7
// Guides formal translations.
Instructions: Use sophisticated vocabulary and a respectful tone. Avoid contractions and slang.
{% elif desired_tone == "informal" %}
// @rule RULE:InformalTranslation category=style priority=7
// Guides informal translations.
Instructions: Use casual language and contractions. Feel free to use slang, but only if appropriate for the context.
{% elif desired_tone == "humorous" %}
// @rule RULE:HumorousTranslation category=style priority=7
// Guides humorous translations.
Instructions: Inject humor into the translation where appropriate, but ensure it doesn't detract from the meaning.
{% else %}
// @rule RULE:NeutralTranslation category=style priority=7
// Guides neutral translations.
Instructions: Maintain a neutral and objective tone. Avoid expressing personal opinions or emotions.
{% endif %}

// @condition CONDITION:IsAdmin
// Checks if the user is an administrator.
{% if user.role == "admin" %}
Admin User
{% else %}
Regular User
{% endif %}

// @condition CONDITION:ToneSpecified
// Checks if a tone is specified.
{% if desired_tone %}
Tone Specified: {{ desired_tone }}
{% else %}
No Tone Specified - Use a neutral tone.
{% endif %}


// @rule RULE:AccuracyPriority category=safety priority=10
// Ensures the translation is accurate.
Instructions: Prioritize accuracy over style. The meaning of the original text must be preserved.

// @breakpoint BREAKPOINT:TranslationStart conditionRef=CONDITION:ToneSpecified
